## Daftar Periksa (Checklist Verifikasi Diri)

| Komponen / Tabel | Poin yang Diperiksa | Cara Verifikasi Mandiri | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| **`users`** | `role` enum berindeks, `nim_nip` unique nullable, softDeletes | Jalankan `php artisan db:table users` | Terpenuhi |
| **`courses`** | `code` unique, `lecturer_id` FK restrictOnDelete | Jalankan `php artisan db:table courses` | Terpenuhi |
| **`course_user`** | Unique composite `(course_id, user_id)`, kolom `enrolled_at` | Jalankan `php artisan db:table course_user` | Terpenuhi |
| **`materials`** | `course_id` cascadeOnDelete & indexed, `uploaded_by` restrictOnDelete | Jalankan `php artisan db:table materials` | Terpenuhi |
| **`assignments`** | `course_id` cascadeOnDelete, composite index `(course_id, due_at)` | Jalankan `php artisan db:table assignments` | Terpenuhi |
| **`submissions`** | Unique composite `(assignment_id, user_id)`, cascadeOnDelete | Jalankan `php artisan db:table submissions` | Terpenuhi |
| **`grades`** | `submission_id` unique (relasi 1-to-1), `graded_by` restrictOnDelete | Jalankan `php artisan db:table grades` | Terpenuhi |
| **Reversibilitas** | Semua migrasi bisa di-rollback tanpa error | Jalankan `php artisan migrate:refresh` | Terpenuhi |
